<title>MEXICO: Mexico May-May inflation seen at 13 pct - Ortiz.</title>
<headline>Mexico May-May inflation seen at 13 pct - Ortiz.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican Finance Minister Guillermo Ortiz reiterated on Wednesday he expected May 1997 to May 1998 inflation to come in around 13 percent.</p>
<p>Ortiz, speaking in an interview with radio network Radio Red, said inflation in the next 12 months from June would be around 12-13 percent.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
